From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sigivb72-netizen <vergilx63@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:53:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] podot: ios: iPadOS editor platform integration

- Enable editor builds' in-process instances; relaunch Main in-process
  when the main loop quits (project manager -> editor -> game -> editor),
  re-creating the rendering layer for the new rendering driver.
- Floating native Stop control and F8 / Cmd+. to stop a running game;
  recovery to the editor if iPadOS terminated the app while a game ran.
- Mouse/trackpad support: buttons, hover, scroll (pan gesture), pinch
  (magnify), pointer shapes from the cursor shape.
- Apple Pencil as a precise mouse with pressure/tilt in the editor
  (opt-in for projects: input_devices/pointing/ios/pencil_as_mouse).
- Hardware keyboard: key repeat, connection change notifications.
- Native file dialogs through UIDocumentPickerViewController with
  persisted security-scoped bookmarks.
- Open folders in the Files app (shareddocuments://).
